# S-173 / TST-6, the core loop, run 2 of 3: steps 1 to 10 on the profile 10-setup.steps
# built (tooling/drive <profile> 20-core-loop.steps, no pages: the session comes back).
# The end of this run is step 11's quit: tooling/drive asks Stedding to quit the way the
# Dock's Quit does, and the next run (30-relaunch.steps) is the relaunch.
# GUESS marks a coordinate to confirm against setup-02-open.png and setup-03-rail.png.
activate
wait 3
# Step 1: the window as the last run left it.
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-01-start.png
# Step 2: click each row in the open sidebar.
click 150 165
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-02a-open-a.png
# GUESS: Page B, indented under the folder header at y = 189.
click 170 256
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-02b-open-b.png
# GUESS
click 150 301
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-02c-open-c.png
# GUESS
click 150 347
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-02d-open-d.png
# Step 3: close the sidebar to the rail with its toggle.
click 102 14
wait 2
hover 700 500
wait 2.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-03-rail.png
# Step 4: click rows in the rail. After each click the pointer leaves the rail and the
# hover-expanded sidebar folds away again, so the next click lands on the rail's rows.
# GUESS (all four rail rows): A 168, the folder's glyph 218, B 268, C 318, D 368.
click 42 198
hover 700 500
wait 2.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-04a-rail-a.png
click 42 291
hover 700 500
wait 2.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-04b-rail-b.png
click 42 391
hover 700 500
wait 2.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-04c-rail-d.png
click 42 198
hover 700 500
wait 2.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-04d-rail-a-again.png
# Step 5: open the sidebar again with the rail's toggle.
click 42 50
wait 2
hover 700 500
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-05-open.png
# Step 6: switch Space by its chip (Work, the second chip).
click 182 848
wait 2
hover 700 500
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-06-chip-work.png
# Step 7: switch Space by its key (Play).
key 3+ctrl
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-07-ctrl3-play.png
# Step 8: previous Space twice (Work, then Home).
key left+cmd+alt
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-08a-prev-work.png
key left+cmd+alt
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-08b-prev-home.png
# Step 9: switch Space by choosing another Space's tab in the command bar.
key t+cmd
wait 1
type Page F
wait 2
key down
wait 0.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-09a-bar.png
key enter
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-09b-bar-play.png
# Step 10: collapse the folder with another tab on screen, switch away and back.
key 1+ctrl
wait 2
click 150 165
wait 1
# GUESS: the folder header.
click 150 211
wait 1.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-10a-collapsed.png
key 2+ctrl
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-10b-away.png
key 1+ctrl
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst6-10c-back.png
# Step 11 begins here: the run ends, and tooling/drive quits Stedding.
